---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Start([Cancel run]) --> Valid{Accessible active run?}
    Valid -- No --> Error([Not found or terminal-state error])
    Valid -- Yes --> Commit[Atomically record revocation and destinations]
    Commit --> Deliver[Bounded direct DB delivery]
    Deliver --> Applied{Every destination applied?}
    Applied -- No --> Pending[Return pending; coordinator retries outstanding work]
    Pending --> Deliver
    Applied -- Yes --> Quiet{Every destination quiescent?}
    Quiet -- No --> Finish[Workers stop new work and preserve safe results]
    Finish --> Pending
    Quiet -- Yes --> Settle[Cancel unfinished work and commit receipts]
    Settle --> Event[Persist cancellation summary and event]
    Event --> Done([Terminal cancellation])
